@startuml

actor User

participant "Chat API" as API

participant Planner

participant Retriever

database Qdrant

participant Reranker

participant PromptBuilder

participant LLM

User -> API : Ask Question

API -> Planner

Planner -> Retriever

Retriever -> Qdrant

Qdrant --> Retriever

Retriever -> Reranker

Reranker --> Planner

Planner -> PromptBuilder

PromptBuilder -> LLM

LLM --> API

API --> User

@enduml